1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Kernel verified</span></div><h1>Certified critical-line bound 0.673587173310297059918152909095</h1><p>Refines the attributed s1R nine-point Gram certificate against all 13,046 ordinary leaves and the original global guards. Preserves the unconditional dyadic and cumulative counting bounds. Finite walk proofs use literal internal states and strictly earlier proved cuts to bound per-command kernel memory. Transparent source packing expands to ordinary Nat numerals.</p></div><div class="record-big-score"><span>Certified lower bound</span><strong>67.3587173310<sup>%</sup></strong><code>κ = <!-- -->(3337839448633819172184136761695440236797 : ℝ) / 4955319193847235264050000000000000000000</code></div></div></div></section><section class="shell record-details"><article><span class="eyebrow">Record evidence</span><h2>かふぇ- zkvoxels</h2><dl class="record-metadata"><div><dt><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar-days" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18"></path><path d="M8 14h.01"></path><path d="M12 14h.01"></path><path d="M16 14h.01"></path><path d="M8 18h.01"></path><path d="M12 18h.01"></path><path d="M16 18h.01"></path></svg> Date</dt><dd><time dateTime="2026-10-18T03:40:45.271Z">Oct 18, 2026 · 03:40 UTC</time></dd></div><div><dt><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-user-round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="5"></circle><path d="M20 21a8 8 0 0 0-16 0"></path></sv